              <li><strong>Smart Configuration Wizards:</strong> Guide users through complex setup with conversational AI</li>
              <li><strong>Intelligent Search &amp; Discovery:</strong> Natural language search across your product data</li>
              <li><strong>Automated Data Entry:</strong> Extract and populate forms from documents or conversations</li>
              <li><strong>Smart Recommendations:</strong> Suggest next actions based on user context and goals</li>
              <li><strong>Predictive Maintenance:</strong> Alert users before issues occur based on usage patterns</li>
            </ul>
            <h4 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-2">Technology Stack</h4>
            <p class="small mb-2">LLM integration (GPT-4, Claude, Gemini); embedding models for semantic search; product database integration; user context and permissions; session state management.</p>
            <p class="mb-0 small">
