              Average resolution 72hrs → 18sec (99.7% reduction); 5,127 tickets in 90 days; 4.7/5 satisfaction; 24/7/365 availability.
            </div>
            <p class="mb-0 small">
              <strong>Example:</strong> Wellness clinic AI receptionist reduced no-shows from 35% to 6%, recovering ~$28K/month.
              <%= link_to "Read case study →", case_studies_path, anchor: "wellness-clinic", class: "text-primary text-decoration-none ms-1" %>
