            <p class="small mb-1"><strong>Agent cannot:</strong> Initiate refunds over $X; change account settings.</p>
            <p class="small mb-1"><strong>Human approval:</strong> Refunds, account modifications, suspected fraud.</p>
            <p class="small mb-0"><strong>Audit:</strong> Full conversation log, data accessed, actions taken.</p>
